*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
coverage/

# Harness build output
harness/dist/

# Docs site build output. Anchored: an unanchored `site/` also matches
# docs/site/, where the pages the site is built *from* live.
/site/

# Agent worktrees. A subagent given its own git worktree gets it checked out
# in here, which is a second copy of the whole repository sitting inside the
# first one - 1.6GB of it while this was written. Ignored so that a `git add`
# that reaches wider than it meant to cannot sweep one into a commit.
.claude/
